WEBVTT

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:21.500
<i>Train arriving at platform three.</i>

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:24.370
<i>Please wait behind the line.</i>

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.910
Today will be a very busy day.

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:44.500
RAGE

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:34.330
<i>It was nice of Ms. Washimi</i>
<i>to talk to the president on my behalf</i>

00:01:35.410 --> 00:01:37.450
<i>but given what Director Ton is like...</i>

00:01:41.450 --> 00:01:44.450
<i>I'm a little... scared.</i>

00:01:55.540 --> 00:01:57.370
Fenneko, what's up?

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:58.620
There's chaos...

00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:00.830
in Accounting!

00:02:02.370 --> 00:02:03.790
ACCOUNTING DEPARTMENT

00:02:06.370 --> 00:02:08.950
Good morning, everyone!

00:02:13.410 --> 00:02:16.700
Good morning!
Let's do our best today!

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:19.080
Mrs. Kabae, good morning!

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:24.200
Mrs. Kabae is down too!
Be careful!

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:27.370
Director Ton! I beg you! Please stop!

00:02:27.870 --> 00:02:30.120
I'll change the water
in the humidifier!

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:31.950
Don't be absurd, Komiya!

00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:35.000
It's my problem, I'll deal with it.

00:02:35.790 --> 00:02:37.160
No way!

00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:41.660
<i>I never imagined...</i>

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:44.040
<i>such mass devastation.</i>

00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:46.040
TEA ROOM

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:53.830
<i>This is awkward</i>
<i>but I suppose he's trying to repent.</i>

00:02:57.750 --> 00:02:59.500
Can I join you?

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:01.830
What is going on?

00:03:01.910 --> 00:03:04.660
I can't take Director Ton's cheerful mood.
I need to hide.

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:08.660
Our minds and bodies
can't function properly in there.

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:11.950
Oh! You also ran away?

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:14.580
-I am going crazy!
-What, what?

00:03:14.660 --> 00:03:16.120
We're cramped here!

00:03:16.620 --> 00:03:18.410
I'm not coming to hide!

00:03:18.950 --> 00:03:21.370
I just need someone
to open the jar for me.

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:23.580
-I'll do it!
-Director Ton!

00:03:23.660 --> 00:03:26.160
This is the evacuation area
for Accounting.

00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:28.080
Excuse me!

00:03:28.580 --> 00:03:30.290
Coming through!

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:36.830
Retsuko, don't tell me you're bringing
this cup of tea to Director Ton?

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:40.330
I feel like I should.

00:03:40.660 --> 00:03:43.620
Seriously? You're returning
to the danger zone?

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:44.870
Be careful!

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:47.000
Don't make eye contact!

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:48.410
I'll be fine.

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:59.200
Director Ton. Here's your tea.

00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:03.410
Thank you!

00:04:05.540 --> 00:04:06.830
Excuse me.

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:21.660
<i>Don't tell me... Is she the one</i>
<i>who ratted me out to the president?</i>

00:04:24.290 --> 00:04:25.290
KARAOKE

00:04:25.370 --> 00:04:29.370
By the looks of it, it's a success.

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:33.040
Thank you very much, Ms. Washimi!
It's all thanks to you!

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:35.540
But it's too early to celebrate, isn't it?

00:04:37.370 --> 00:04:41.000
There's still a high wall
between you and Director Ton.

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:43.370
He's being nice because
he received a warning.

00:04:43.450 --> 00:04:46.870
Nothing has changed
in your relationship.

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:51.790
You two need a chance
to find common ground.

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:54.160
How about...

00:04:54.950 --> 00:04:56.250
a drinking party?

00:04:58.370 --> 00:05:01.500
I don't really like office parties.

00:05:02.540 --> 00:05:04.330
A lot of girls are like that lately.

00:05:04.410 --> 00:05:07.000
Yes! The young people I know
are the same!

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:10.750
Hey, Retsuko. You might think
it's old-fashioned, but...

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:15.450
developing relationships over drinks
is still very effective.

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:17.580
Be smart and take the opportunity.

00:05:23.700 --> 00:05:26.290
Man, I thought I was going to die!

00:05:26.370 --> 00:05:29.200
-Mr. Haida!
-What?

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:32.120
Are you coming to
end-of-the-month office drinks?

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:35.830
Ah, what a pain. What should I do?

00:05:35.910 --> 00:05:39.370
We pay money to listen to the bosses
singing their own praises.

00:05:39.450 --> 00:05:41.910
I wish they'd give us a break.

00:05:42.660 --> 00:05:44.580
Put me down as a "no".

00:05:44.660 --> 00:05:49.660
That's a "no" from Mr. Haida.
How about you, Ms. Retsuko?

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:51.500
A "yes" from me.

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:53.870
"Yes" it is.

00:05:56.200 --> 00:05:58.160
Retsuko, are you going?

00:05:58.700 --> 00:05:59.790
Yes.

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:01.330
I changed my mind.

00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:04.120
What? Didn't you just say
office parties are a pain?

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:07.950
Shut up! I changed my mind, okay?!
Just put me down as a "yes"!

00:06:08.410 --> 00:06:10.620
Should be fun. I'm in too.

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:18.790
IZAKAYA
HOT POT

00:06:18.870 --> 00:06:21.120
Where are you now?

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:24.080
What? Just getting on the train?

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:28.120
But we've started
the first round of drinks already!

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:31.370
Okay.
Okay, understood.

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:33.830
<i>Just make your way over here.</i>

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:38.290
Shit...

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:41.040
This party was supposed
to be my chance...

00:06:41.120 --> 00:06:43.160
Cheers!

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:51.700
-Where is Haida?
-He's running late.

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:05.290
<i>He has some nerve sitting next to Retsuko!</i>

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:08.950
Haida!

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:10.950
Over here!

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:20.370
Director Ton, you really
know how to drink!

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:23.750
I'm in a good mood today.

00:07:27.450 --> 00:07:31.950
<i>Director Gori, Ms. Washimi,</i>
<i>please watch over me.</i>

00:07:39.450 --> 00:07:41.620
Director Ton,
thank you for your hard work.

00:07:41.700 --> 00:07:43.410
Oh, short...

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:46.160
Retsuko!

00:07:46.250 --> 00:07:47.580
Let me refill your glass.

00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:58.290
Label facing up, you see!

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:01.790
So you remember!

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:11.500
You still aren't pouring it the right way.
Give me the bottle.

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:23.700
What are your plans about the job?
Are you staying? Or quitting?

00:08:25.040 --> 00:08:27.200
I intend to continue.

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:30.580
I see.

00:08:32.370 --> 00:08:34.870
I also learned my lesson.

00:08:35.250 --> 00:08:38.700
I was worked to the bone
when I was young.

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:40.830
Now if you give orders the same way,

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:43.580
they complain of "power harassment".

00:08:44.450 --> 00:08:46.750
Times have changed.

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:49.660
I guess I'm growing old.

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:55.080
You've been through a lot as well.
I went a little too far...

00:08:55.830 --> 00:08:59.290
I'm sorry about everything.

00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:02.120
Director Ton...

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:05.620
I am sorry for getting things wrong
all the time.

00:09:06.290 --> 00:09:08.450
There's so much I can learn from you!

00:09:12.660 --> 00:09:16.450
And... don't be hard on yourself.

00:09:17.040 --> 00:09:19.910
The department wouldn't be the same
without your strong leadership.

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:24.540
And I'm sure that the president

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:27.950
knows how you feel.

00:09:32.540 --> 00:09:33.830
The president?

00:09:35.870 --> 00:09:38.870
How do you know
that the president cautioned me?

00:09:40.830 --> 00:09:43.160
So the truth comes out.

00:09:44.120 --> 00:09:45.830
You short-timer!

00:09:46.330 --> 00:09:52.080
No! I was just trying to deepen
my relationship with you.

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:55.040
I can't stand women...

00:09:56.410 --> 00:09:57.290
Actually...

00:09:58.000 --> 00:10:01.950
I can't stand women like you!

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:04.950
That backfired completely!

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:12.450
Thank you! Thank you!

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:16.540
And now, as usual, it's time
for the karaoke competition!

00:10:17.250 --> 00:10:20.700
Your party organizer Ookami
will sing first.

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:41.580
<i>I was a new hire</i>
<i>Now I'm spitting hot fire</i>

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:45.500
<i>T-O-N's about to B-R-I-N-G</i>
<i>The hurt on you</i>

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:49.750
<i>Hey Retsuko! Why you working</i>
<i>If you hate your job so bad?</i>

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:52.200
<i>I dunno</i>
<i>It's just what you do</i>

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:55.250
<i>'Cause Retsuko's killin' time</i>
<i>Until she finds herself a man</i>

00:10:55.330 --> 00:10:58.040
<i>I dunno</i>
<i>It's just what you do</i>

00:10:58.120 --> 00:11:00.700
<i>Meek and mediocre</i>
<i>You never really stand out</i>

00:11:00.790 --> 00:11:03.580
<i>Waitin' for your check</i>
<i>Like it's nothing but a hand-out</i>

00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:05.660
<i>You're not the best</i>
<i>Or the worst I've seen</i>

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:08.830
<i>I called you out hard</i>
<i>And I'mma get away clean</i>

00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:11.000
Ton! Ton!

00:11:15.160 --> 00:11:17.700
Retsuko! He just dissed you!

00:11:17.790 --> 00:11:19.790
-And he isn't wrong!
-Shut up!

00:11:20.330 --> 00:11:22.700
Retsuko! Retsuko!

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:26.120
Retsuko! Retsuko!

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:28.200
Are you going to let him say that?!

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:30.620
Aren't you upset?

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:37.330
Retsuko! Retsuko! Retsuko!

00:11:38.160 --> 00:11:40.790
Retsuko! Retsuko!

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:45.200
I...

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:50.870
I...

00:11:54.790 --> 00:11:56.580
No comeback from you then?

00:11:57.160 --> 00:11:59.000
<i>What's the matter?</i>
<i>Does the cat have your tongue?</i>

00:11:59.580 --> 00:12:01.620
<i>This is why you're on the bottom rung</i>

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:03.830
<i>Chained to your computer</i>
<i>And you're sweating like a loser</i>

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:06.120
<i>While I crush you like a closer</i>
<i>Like a lyric bulldozer</i>

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:08.540
<i>Asleep on your feet</i>
<i>Come on, you're dead meat</i>

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:11.080
<i>No play, you're DOA</i>
<i>You got nothing to say</i>

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:12.080
<i>You're lazy</i>

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:13.700
<i>'Cause you go with the flow</i>

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:16.120
<i>And I can't figure out</i>
<i>If you're coming or going</i>

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:18.700
<i>Your sad little life</i>
<i>Got no rhythm or rhyme</i>

00:12:18.790 --> 00:12:21.370
<i>I betcha that's why</i>
<i>You get drunk all the time</i>

00:12:26.750 --> 00:12:30.330
There you have it.
Director Ton's epic rap!

00:12:31.160 --> 00:12:33.450
Ton! Ton! Ton!

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:38.540
<i>Director Gori... Ms. Washimi...</i>

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:40.910
<i>Even though you were rooting for me...</i>

00:12:41.910 --> 00:12:43.120
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:46.290
<i>I couldn't do it after all.</i>

00:13:00.370 --> 00:13:02.370
I'll sing the song for this number.

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:04.330
Oh, sure.

00:13:05.330 --> 00:13:07.250
Is it a nursery rhyme?

00:13:12.500 --> 00:13:13.830
SEND

00:13:17.250 --> 00:13:18.870
What is this?

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:25.790
Retsuko! Retsuko!

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:27.950
Retsuko! Retsuko!

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:30.160
Retsuko! Retsuko!

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:35.950
<i>Retsuko! Retsuko!</i>

00:13:42.700 --> 00:13:44.870
RAGE

00:13:50.000 --> 00:13:52.160
<i>Why'd you go again?</i>
<i>Nobody wants to hear it!</i>

00:13:52.250 --> 00:13:54.450
<i>Your beats are weak</i>
<i>And your rap sucks</i>

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:56.580
<i>Look at you standing there</i>
<i>Wanting a reply</i>

00:13:56.660 --> 00:13:58.700
<i>Here it comes, pig!</i>
<i>Here's my battle cry!</i>

00:13:58.790 --> 00:14:00.870
<i>You're a shitty boss!</i>

00:14:00.950 --> 00:14:03.200
<i>You're a shitty boss!</i>

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:09.160
<i>I hate you so much!</i>

00:14:17.910 --> 00:14:19.250
Remember this.

00:14:19.700 --> 00:14:23.410
Ten years... Twenty years from now...

00:14:23.830 --> 00:14:30.700
One day you'll become a shitty boss too...

00:14:38.580 --> 00:14:40.950
Excuse me. Last orders?

00:15:08.910 --> 00:15:10.910
Subtitle translation: John Haguewood
